			<heading>
				Elihu Condemns Job
			</heading>
			<begin-paragraph>
			</begin-paragraph>
			<v n="1">And Elihu answered and said :</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18035002">
			</marker>
			<v n="2">Do you say ,<crossref let="v" cid="c18035002.1" />‘ It is my right before God , ’</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18035003">
			</marker>
			<v n="3">How am I better off than if I had sinned ? ’</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18035004">
			</marker>
			<v n="4">and<crossref let="x" cid="c18035004.1" />your friends with you .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18035005">
			</marker>
			<v n="5">and behold the clouds , which are higher than you .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18035006">
			</marker>
			<v n="6">And if your transgressions are multiplied , what do you do to him ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18035007">
			</marker>
			<v n="7">Or what does he receive from your hand ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18035008">
			</marker>
			<v n="8">and your righteousness<crossref let="b" cid="c18035008.1" />a son of man .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18035009">
			</marker>
			<v n="9">they call for help because of the arm of<crossref let="e" cid="c18035009.3" />the mighty .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18035010">
			</marker>
			<v n="10">who gives<crossref let="g" cid="c18035010.2" />songs in the night ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18035011">
			</marker>
			<v n="11">and makes us wiser than the birds of the heavens ? ’</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18035012">
			</marker>
			<v n="12">because of the pride of evil men .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18035013">
			</marker>
			<v n="13">nor does the Almighty regard it .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18035014">
			</marker>
			<v n="14">that the case is before him , and you are<crossref let="k" cid="c18035014.2" />waiting for him !</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18035015">
			</marker>
			<v n="15">and he does not take much note of transgression ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18035016">
			</marker>
			<v n="16">he<crossref let="m" cid="c18035016.1" />multiplies words<crossref let="n" cid="c18035016.2" />without knowledge . ”</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18035017">
			</marker>
			<end-paragraph>
			</end-paragraph>
